    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Continent</strong> is a fast-paced, skill-driven action MMORPG where precision, timing, and reflexes decide every battle. Thrown into a world fractured by chaos, you'll carve your own path through relentless combat, epic boss encounters, and a world shaped by movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tab-targeting. Every strike is aimed, every dodge timed, and animation cancels offer freedom for those who master them. The combat is real-time, fluid, and deeply rewarding\u2014built to feel great whether you're learning the ropes or chasing perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no Pay2Win</strong> mechanics, <strong>Dark Continent</strong> rewards your dedication, not your wallet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f REAL-TIME, SKILL-BASED COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, roll, dash, and strike with precision. Every attack must be aimed and every animation cancel executed with perfect timing. No tab-targeting, no button mashing\u2014only your skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc79 EPIC BOSS ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge massive, cinematic bosses with complex behaviors, unique attack patterns, and escalating difficulty. You\u2019ll need strategy, reflexes, and quick adaptation to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEEL EVERY HIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t just fast\u2014it\u2019s <i>impactful</i>. Every move is built around responsiveness and satisfying feedback, making every fight feel fluid and visceral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc32 UNLOCK GROUND AND FLYING MOUNTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a massive world on unique mounts\u2014ride through ancient battlefields or take to the skies on flying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d A WORLD SHAPED BY MOVEMENT AND COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic, immersive world filled with hidden secrets, environmental hazards, and high-stakes encounters. Movement isn't just traversal\u2014it\u2019s a weapon in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udeab NO PAY2WIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strength comes from your effort, not your wallet. <i>Dark Continent</i> rewards dedication, skill, and mastery\u2014not microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dark Continent</strong> is a fast-paced, skill-driven action MMORPG where precision, timing, and reflexes decide every battle. Thrown into a world fractured by chaos, you'll carve your own path through relentless combat, epic boss encounters, and a world shaped by movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No tab-targeting. Every strike is aimed, every dodge timed, and animation cancels offer freedom for those who master them. The combat is real-time, fluid, and deeply rewarding\u2014built to feel great whether you're learning the ropes or chasing perfection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>no Pay2Win</strong> mechanics, <strong>Dark Continent</strong> rewards your dedication, not your wallet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9f1f3c36c9f8340fccf973c88deae4ce.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2694\ufe0f REAL-TIME, SKILL-BASED COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, roll, dash, and strike with precision. Every attack must be aimed and every animation cancel executed with perfect timing. No tab-targeting, no button mashing\u2014only your skill determines the outcome.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/87824d71d33a37a1d717eebb5e74134a.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc79 EPIC BOSS ENCOUNTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge massive, cinematic bosses with complex behaviors, unique attack patterns, and escalating difficulty. You\u2019ll need strategy, reflexes, and quick adaptation to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/e6151656ae5dae36d1f39f99e1de8099.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udd25 FEEL EVERY HIT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat isn\u2019t just fast\u2014it\u2019s <i>impactful</i>. Every move is built around responsiveness and satisfying feedback, making every fight feel fluid and visceral.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.poster.avif?t=1745698974\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.webm?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2636060/extras/9feddfd60b2e86f6aa673e6e8edffa64.mp4?t=1745698974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc32 UNLOCK GROUND AND FLYING MOUNTS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel across a massive world on unique mounts\u2014ride through ancient battlefields or take to the skies on flying creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf0d A WORLD SHAPED BY MOVEMENT AND COMBAT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a dynamic, immersive world filled with hidden secrets, environmental hazards, and high-stakes encounters. Movement isn't just traversal\u2014it\u2019s a weapon in your arsenal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udeab NO PAY2WIN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your strength comes from your effort, not your wallet. <i>Dark Continent</i> rewards dedication, skill, and mastery\u2014not microtransactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
